     ssnnaappiinnffoo — show snapshot location on UFS file systems

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ssnnaappiinnffoo [--vv] --aa
     ssnnaappiinnffoo [--vv] _m_o_u_n_t_p_o_i_n_t

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssnnaappiinnffoo utility searches and displays the location of snapshots on
     UFS file systems.

     Currently it works only on mounted file systems.  It can either search
     one file system or all of them.

     The following options are available:

     --aa      Search for snapshots on all mounted UFS file systems.

     --vv      Verbose mode.

     _m_o_u_n_t_p_o_i_n_t
             Search the file system mounted on this mountpoint.

